update public.club_events set description = $about$The River Lakes Stars, a girls hockey co-op with players from ROCORI, Albany, Paynesville and other area schools, host the Detroit Lakes Lakers in MSHSL varsity play. Detroit Lakes plays in Class A, Section 8A, and is building around a young roster after a tough 2025-26 season. The JV teams play first, at 5 p.m.$about$ where id = 'cb9d3fff-244b-4a2a-950f-69817a497a22';  -- Detroit Lakes Girls Hockey vs River Lakes
update public.club_events set description = $about$The St. Cloud Crush, the combined Apollo and Tech high school dance team, hosts its annual Crush Dance Show, the team's main fundraiser. School teams and local studios from around Central Minnesota perform jazz, lyrical, hip hop and kick routines. Last year's show doubled as a clothing drive for District 742 students and collected more than 250 items.$about$ where id = '26a0d3c7-e8c7-4f03-8a19-d41f973cc773';  -- Crush Dance Show
