update public.club_events set description = $about$The Ptanyetu Powwow comes to the College of Saint Benedict's Clemens Fieldhouse in the Haehn Campus Center, free and open to the public. Grand entries are at 1 and 5 p.m., with a hand drum contest, food trucks and vendors. CSB+SJU co-host with St. Cloud State, St. Cloud Technical and Community College and District 742. Questions go to Ted Gordon.$about$ where id = 'efbe0cf2-9264-476d-92da-a33b613998b2';  -- Ptanyetu Powwow
update public.club_events set description = $about$CSB+SJU music professor Amy Grinsteiner gives a piano recital of Florence Price's Sonata in E Minor, Arthur Cunningham's Harlem Suite, and four water-themed pieces by women composers including Amy Beach, Margaret Bonds, Teresa Carreño and Emahoy Tsege Mariam Gebru. Free.$about$ where id = '4c7ae599-c935-4348-9434-3a4719631890';  -- Faculty Recital: Amy Grinsteiner
update public.club_events set description = $about$An informal recital of piano music played by CSB+SJU student pianists in the Great Hall at Saint John's. Free.$about$ where id = '55005179-ee70-4c41-a5d6-df19d33c8524';  -- Piano Recital
update public.club_events set description = $about$Soprano Gyehyun Jung, a CSB+SJU music professor who teaches voice and vocal pedagogy, presents an evening of music for voice. Free.$about$ where id = '9377cd8c-a5a7-4b5f-bfc5-d1f708b3484f';  -- Faculty Recital: Gyehyun Jung
update public.club_events set description = $about$The CSB Figure Skating Club, a student-run, no-cut club, performs after the first period of Saint Benedict's MIAC hockey game against Concordia. Puck drop is at 4 p.m. at Ritsche Arena in St. Cloud's Municipal Athletic Complex (the MAC). Admission is free for students.$about$ where id = '22d8d694-60cf-498c-96ab-e670e4ba5372';  -- CSB Figure Skating Club Performance
update public.club_events set description = $about$Christmas with Saint Ben's & Saint John's is the colleges' decades-old holiday tradition of music and readings, with nearly 150 student musicians from the Chamber Choir, Men's Chorus, Women's Choir, Orchestra and Brass Choir. The program mixes carols, spoken word and choral works, including Hovland's The Glory of the Father. This off-campus performance fills in while the Basilica of St. Mary is renovated, and choir alumni may join in on two pieces. Tickets are $22 for adults, $20 for seniors 60+ and $15 for students.$about$ where id = 'db4e3856-21e5-4633-bdc2-3af18c69b484';  -- Christmas with CSB SJU
update public.club_events set description = $about$Christmas with Saint Ben's & Saint John's is the colleges' decades-old holiday tradition of music and readings, with nearly 150 student musicians from the Chamber Choir, Men's Chorus, Women's Choir, Orchestra and Brass Choir. The program mixes carols, spoken word and choral works, including Hovland's The Glory of the Father. The St. John's Boys' Choir joins the Great Hall shows. Tickets are $22 for adults, $20 for seniors 60+ and $15 for students.$about$ where id = 'd1fd4802-67b6-4798-b3bb-31ea548aab57';  -- Christmas with CSB SJU
update public.club_events set description = $about$The CSB+SJU All-College Choir, singers from across both campuses, performs an afternoon program of choral music. Free.$about$ where id = 'c0694c82-8f0e-4c1e-a1a3-c4ffa5125d07';  -- All College Choir
update public.club_events set description = $about$The CSB+SJU Wind Ensemble plays its Winter Concert, celebrating the season. Free.$about$ where id = '86f76d7e-479e-4eda-9213-115a8d491146';  -- Wind Ensemble
update public.club_events set description = $about$The CSB+SJU Jazz Ensemble closes the fall semester with an evening of jazz in Colman Theatre. Free.$about$ where id = '536f7e94-5b16-42a5-b83c-7a9f6e85efd1';  -- Jazz Ensemble
update public.club_events set description = $about$Make spooky Halloween Diamond Dotz magnets at Clemens Library, one of the CSB+SJU Libraries' drop-in craft and game nights.$about$ where id = 'e4063e48-30c9-4692-972a-df2d2f22d0be';  -- Spooky Halloween Diamond Dotz
update public.club_events set description = $about$Unplugged at Alcuin is the CSB+SJU Libraries' acoustic music series in the Learning Commons. This night features If Nothing Else, a Minnesota band led by drummer Justin Willard that calls its sound Northern Rock: country storytelling with rock energy. The band got its start in small-town bars and community events and has since played festival stages, including the Stearns County Fair. The set runs about an hour in the Fireplace Lounge.$about$ where id = 'cfb054d9-4469-4976-93bf-ecf690a2c415';  -- Unplugged at Alcuin: If Nothing Else
update public.club_events set description = $about$The CSB+SJU Libraries' Makerspace opens its tool bench for a Fix-It Clinic, with pliers, tweezers, screwdrivers and more on hand. Bring something broken, like a loose screw or a shoe that lost its sole, and staff will work through it with you. Not everything can be fixed, but they will help find a solution. Drop in any time during the two hours.$about$ where id = 'ced7c480-6d54-4181-9d6c-25361b4ae22d';  -- Fix-It Clinic
update public.club_events set description = $about$Therapy dogs visit the CSB+SJU libraries for an evening of petting and a break from studying. The Libraries' own page calls this night Paws for Success and adds campus resource stations, with academic advising, tutoring and more, at Alcuin Library. Drop in any time between 7 and 9.$about$ where id = '4e40da39-7fe6-48a9-8562-b34897b17f4e';  -- Therapy Dogs
update public.club_events set description = $about$Clemens Library hosts a Magic: The Gathering night, the collectible card game where players duel as wizards. It is co-sponsored by the campus TableTop Gaming club, and free cards are handed out, so newcomers can join without a deck of their own.$about$ where id = 'ff1e0ee7-36f2-4785-b3ad-400701e92997';  -- Magic the Gathering
update public.club_events set description = $about$Popcorn Fridays bring free popcorn to the Learning Commons by The Schu at Saint John's. Library staff are on hand to share what the CSB+SJU Libraries offer. Stop by for a snack on the way to class.$about$ where id = 'a74cbba1-2112-4a84-9e7e-f9462ae26585';  -- Popcorn Fridays at the Learning Commons
update public.club_events set description = $about$Purl & Looped is the CSB+SJU Libraries' laid-back knitting and crocheting club, meeting in the Clemens Library Fireplace Lounge. It is a place to work on a project and make friends, and all skill levels are welcome, beginners included.$about$ where id = '6cd37ab2-2c9f-4681-a3b8-6969e06c8857';  -- Purl & Looped
